## How do we calculate the regression line for 80% vaccination rate?

::: columns
::: {.column width="40%"}
 

$$\begin{aligned}
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 46.833 + 0.075 \ \text{CP} 
+ 0.168\ \text{VR}\\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 46.833 + 0.075 \ \text{CP} 
+ 0.168\cdot 80\\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 46.833 + 0.075 \ \text{CP}
+ 13.463 \\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 60.297 + 0.075 \ \text{CP}
\end{aligned}$$
