# Learning Objectives

1.  Understand the population multiple linear regression model through equations.
2.  Fit MLR model (in `R`) with one continuous and one categorical predictor.
3.  Interpret MLR coefficient estimates from model with one continuous and one categorical predictor.
4.  Fit MLR model (in `R`) with two continuous predictors.

::: lob
5.  Interpret MLR coefficient estimates from model with two continuous predictors.
